      "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n## Copilot review overview\n\n### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe sampling loop correctly advances its cursor and the regression test covers single- and multi-wrap batches.\n\n**Review effort:** Balanced  \n**Findings:** None\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nEnsures curriculum sampling fills batches requiring multiple passes over small clusters.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Repeatedly reshuffles and samples until the requested count is reached.\n- Adds regression coverage for several batch sizes and training steps.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `deepspeed/​runtime/​data_pipeline/​data_sampling/​data_sampler.py` | Fills requests across repeated cluster wraps. |\r\n| `tests/​unit/​runtime/​test_data_efficiency.py` | Tests full, balanced batches from a two-item cluster. |\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/deepspeedai/DeepSpeed/new/master?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>",
